  "created": "2026-06-19T12:50:45.397Z",
  "description": "Standalone session recording, replay, and query nodes for FluxFlow: a recorder (input -> stored record), a replay source (stored records out), and a query node (request -> result + session metadata) over a host-provided ISessionStore, with broadcast output/error/event ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Sessions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-19T12:53:21.873Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "G2itN1u30l8M0ZvVa3mzw9wxaFxFmuOjaA0BG5IGw3dXWY9abfYpfn1G3iRKyuzolzKeMr2dZ0u/Jam/wVcD4Q==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 64279,
  "published": "2026-06-19T12:50:45.397Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as three standalone nodes over an injected ISessionStore and TimeProvider: SessionRecorderNode (FlowNode, input -> record), SessionReplayNode (FlowSource, stored records out), and SessionQueryNode (FlowNode, request -> result with an extra Sessions output). Every message is a FlowMessage<T> envelope carrying the correlation id; failures surface on the broadcast Errors port and diagnostics on Events. The node factory, component module, registration extensions, port/type constants, NodeDefinition options reader, and design-metadata provider are removed — construct a node directly and LinkTo the next one. The nodes depend only on FluxFlow.Nodes and run without the engine.",
